  "texts": {
    "攻击提升{0}。未拥有并获得同奏时，导电伤害提升{1}，持续{3}秒。\n未拥有并获得同奏时，队伍中角色获得【羁念】效果并移除【怅念】，导电伤害加成提升{2}，持续{3}秒。同名效果之间不可叠加。\n自身的协奏能量消耗，且消耗值低于{4}点时，获得【怅念】效果并移除队伍中角色的【羁念】，自身导电伤害额外提升{5}，持续{6}秒， 切换至其他角色时，该效果提前结束。": "ATK is increased by {0}. When the wielder gains Unison while not already having it, they gain {1} Electro DMG Bonus for {3}s.\nWhen the wielder gains Unison while not already having it, they remove Yearning Mind and grant all Resonators in the team the Binding Mind effect, granting {2} Electro DMG Bonus for {3}s. Effects with the same name cannot stack.\nWhen the wielder consumes fewer than {4} points of Concerto Energy, they remove Binding Mind from all Resonators on the team and gain the Yearning Mind effect, additionally gaining {5} Electro DMG Bonus for {6}s. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect early.",
    "囚雷困雨": "Locked Thunder, Trapped Rain"
  }
